==== stdout ====
Usage: raphael get <path> [options]
       raphael get --id <id> [options]

Read one area, project, or note.

Options:
      --id <id>       Address by identifier instead of by path.
      --format <fmt>  Format of the returned body: markdown or tiptap. Default markdown.
      --json          Print the result as JSON.
  -h, --help          Show this help.
